direction: right
agent: Agent opens PR
ci: CI custom linters
review: Human review
rule: Repeated mistake becomes rule
map: AGENTS.md map (~100 lines)
docs: docs/ system of record
gc: Background cleanup agent
agent -> ci: run checks
ci -> agent: fail + FIX text
ci -> review: pass
review -> rule: same comment twice
rule -> ci: encode as check
rule -> docs: write principle
map -> docs: points to
map -> agent: read at start
gc -> docs: scan deviations
gc -> agent: small refactor PRs
